                <pb facs="0521" n="401" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg401"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.01/44a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Whitehouse</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-01-17T14:00:00-05:00">January 17, 1931—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>8. Has the Guatemalan Government been recognized by the four other Central
                    American Governments?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
